# StudyHub AI – Mobile App (Expo / React Native)
Run: `npm install` then `npx expo start` (scan QR with Expo Go, or press `a` for Android emulator).
Flow: Splash → Onboarding → Log in → Home / Files / Tasks / Schedule / Chat, plus Upload, AI Summary, Create Task and Profile.
Everything is front-end demo data; connect a real backend/AI API in Chat and Upload.
